        "start_xml_ordinal": 10020,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 470,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 136,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "The depth integrated equations are here presented in their conservative form and therefore appear different to those given in Roelvink, Reniers et al. (2009). However if the global continuity equation (1.9) is multiplied with U and subtracted from equation (1.17) it is easy to show that both forms are mathematically equivalent. The conservative form is preferred here as it is easier to derive the conservative numerical approximations from this form (see chapter 3)."
